\title{ADCPeptideMapper: ADC Peptide Mapper — In-silico Digest & Transition List Generator}
\description{
R Shiny application for Antibody-Drug Conjugate (ADC) peptide mapping. Provides in-silico proteolytic digestion with 11 enzymes, uniqueness filtering against Human / Cynomolgus Monkey / Rat background proteomes, drug-to-antibody ratio (DAR) modeling, linker biotransformation variable modifications, multi-instrument MRM/DIA transition list generation (Skyline, Thermo, SCIEX, Bruker, Agilent, Waters), MRM quality assessment, ADC design and target biology scoring tools, and an AI-powered assistant tab (Anthropic Claude API).
